# Torre Vertice, 2F (C6, contract 49), 16 x 12, interior. column = i, row = j. Open offices cut by a glass partition (gap (7,5..6)) and a closed STORAGE room in the bottom left (1..4,8..11) that only a PAD
# reaches ((9,9) <-> (2,9); a Prime Salve inside). Stairs down (2,2) and up (13,2). Two grunts and two scientists (one by the partition's gap).
@map torre_vertice_2
@size 16 12
@interior yes
@area torre_vertice
@bg 0
@fill carpet_00
@spawn down 2 3 S
@spawn up 13 3 S
@legend
  .  tile=carpet_11
  a  tile=none object=wall_corner
  b  tile=none object=wall_j
  c  tile=none object=wall_win_j
  d  tile=none object=wall_i
  e  tile=carpet_01 object=escalator
  f  tile=carpet_01
